{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/427035-recruiting-for-an-online-irc-zombie-apocalypse-game","id":427035,"title":"Recruiting for an online (irc) zombie apocalypse game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-03T15:11:03-08:00","id":427035,"title":"Recruiting for an online (irc) zombie apocalypse game","content":"Hi<br /> I'm currently preparing for a zombie apocalypse game and am looking for additional players for it.<br /> <br /> <br /> The game will be set in Toyko (if the players prefer i can relocate it to for example New York) and will start out at a college locationwise.<br /> I'm planing on it being set right at the beginning of a zombie apocalypse and for it to be a mix between highschool of the dead and prototype<br /> with the characters trying to survive and find out what the hell is happening.<br /> <br /> Aside from the typical protagonists in this type of setting: Humans and Zombies there will be 3 other beings there<br /> a.) Vampire like beings<br /> b.) Demon like beings<br /> c.) Feral / Werwolf like beings.<br /> <br /> Why do I say &quot;like beings&quot;? Easy: Because they are called that even though they are different from their wod aequivalents.<br /> For example the demon like beings are inspired by the prototype game series. Thus they are not typical pact making demons but instead they can<br /> transform parts of their bodies or even their whole body into weapons, wings, armour and absorb people to take on their form and shape.<br /> Also these species don't like each other too much. Even though individuals of them can work together the vampires and demons have been at war since<br /> a few centuries with the demons almost completely disappearing since a few decades. The werewolfs are caught in the middle of this and often act as<br /> mercenaries for either side or both sides.<br /> <br /